    <string name="info_home_time">
        <![CDATA[<b>Home Time</b> shows the watch\'s time zone.
        When the app sets the watch\'s time (either manually or automatically), it will also set the <b>Home Time,
        Time Offset</b> and <b>DST</b> (if applicable) to the current time zone. So there is no need for swapping your <b>World Time</b> and <b>Home Time</b>
        when travelling to another timezone.]]>
    </string>
    <string name="time_adjustment_info" ><![CDATA[
    <li><b>Time Adjustment</b> setting enables the App to automatically update the watch\'s time 4 times per day.</li>
    <li>At the same time, the App will update the watch\'s <b>Reminders (Events)</b> from your <b>Google Calendar</b> if the <b>Set Reminders from Google Calendar</b> action is enabled</li>
    ]]></string>
