    <string name="adjustment_time_info"><![CDATA[
        <li>Automatic time adjustment occurs 4 times per day, sometime after the hours of 12:00AM, 6:00AM, 12:00PM and 6:00PM.</li>
        <li>This setting sets the number of minutes after the hour when time adjustment occurs. So if you set this value to 25, time adjustment will happen at 12:25AM, 6:25AM, 12:25PM and 6:25PM.</li>
        <li>If you have multiple watches, you can control when to set their time individually.</li>
        ]]></string>
